  "short_description": "<p>Eco-friendly <strong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1411\">belly basket for kids</strong> made of natural seagrass, handwoven in Vietnam. Perfect for toy storage and nursery décor.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"716\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1140\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/VH24054-belly-basket-factory.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" /></p>\n<p data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"716\"><strong data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"271\">Product Description</strong><br data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"274\" />Our handwoven <strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"313\">belly basket for kids</strong> is crafted from 100% natural seagrass by skilled Vietnamese artisans. Lightweight yet durable, this basket is the perfect storage solution for toys, clothes, or everyday essentials in your child’s room. Its soft natural tones and eco-friendly material make it a safe and sustainable choice for modern families. The flexible foldable design allows easy storage and portability, ideal for small spaces.</p>\n<p data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"1045\">By purchasing this product, you are not only choosing a stylish and functional home accessory but also supporting traditional Vietnamese handicrafts. Each basket provides stable income for rural artisans during their farming off-season, helping preserve cultural values and protect the environment by using natural materials.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1065\"><strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1063\">Key Features</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1347\">\n<li data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1129\">\n<p data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1129\">Material: 100% natural seagrass, eco-friendly &amp; sustainable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1190\">\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1190\">Handwoven by Vietnamese artisans with traditional skills</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1235\">\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1235\">Lightweight, foldable, and easy to carry</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1284\">\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1284\">Safe for kids – soft texture, no sharp edges</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1347\">\n<p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1347\">Multi-purpose use: toy storage, laundry, clothes, or décor</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1858\" />\n<p data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"2123\">👉 <strong data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1901\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam</strong>:<br data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1905\" />We provide wholesale belly baskets made from natural seagrass with bulk options for retailers and distributors worldwide. For inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2090\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2088\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong> | WhatsApp: <strong data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2120\">+84-975810168</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"2123\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1144\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/VH24054-belly-basket-manufacturer.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\" /></p>",
